{
 "_about": "v79 (C2): the wordings of a sentence that states the charge or the claim (src/rag/posture.py charge_re: charge_labels, charged_by_name). One regular expression each, case-insensitive, joined with «|». Before v79 these were posture._CHARGE_RE in code; the six marked v79 are new. A sentence matching one of them gives its articles to the charge (posture.sentence_articles: the codes' citations and the special laws' of data/special_laws.json).",
